cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "climbing_fall_analysis: 室内抱石与攀岩坠落损伤的多层级建模"
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Multi-level modelling of indoor bouldering and climbing fall injury,
  combining a pad-impact ODE, 2D ankle rotation, a head-neck branch and
  Monte Carlo sampling, validated against literature targets.
keywords:
  - bouldering
  - climbing fall
  - injury biomechanics
  - ankle ligament
  - finite element
  - Monte Carlo
repository-code: "https://github.com/CurrenWong/climbing_fall_analysis"
authors:
  - name: "climbing_fall_analysis contributors"
